B.Ot=new A.A("Pretty Shells","Colorful shells wash ashore. Look, but leave them there.","Keep the memory with your eyes, and leave nature as it is.",B.M)
B.Sk=new A.A("Running Crab","A little crab runs to the sea. Give it room!","Make way for the smaller and weaker.",B.t)
