B.PG=new A.A("Lost Child","A little child looks for their mother on the beach. Let us help!","Help the lost \u2014 may you always be helped too.",B.t)
B.Pp=new A.A("Whale Passes","A big whale passes in the distance. So amazing!","The big is not always scary \u2014 it is just passing by.",B.t)
B.Od=new A.A("Clean Beach","Kiko invites friends to pick up trash together. A cleaner beach!","Cleanliness is a shared job \u2014 invite your friends.",B.F)
