B.PR=new A.A("Heading Home","Evening comes. The fishermen return with fish for their families.","Today's hard work makes the family happy.",B.t)
B.Pk=new A.A("Turtles Return","The baby turtle from before is big now! It returns to the beach.","What you protect will come back to say thank you.",B.t)
B.Q3=new A.A("Clean Beach Forever","The last day. The final boss and many friends are waiting.","Put trash in the bin \u2014 not just in the game, but every day!",B.F)
